{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09649","headline":"赴犍爲经龙阁道 · 岑参","name":"赴犍爲经龙阁道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侧径转青壁，危梁透沧波。\n汗流出鸟道，胆碎窥龙涡。\n骤雨暗谿口，归云网松萝。\n屡闻羌儿笛，厌听巴童歌。\n江路险复永，梦魂愁更多。\n圣朝幸典郡，不敢嫌岷峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}